#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:32 1a04fc58c10f4b50874d936151874270
msgid ""
"**Description**: Query experimentally validated interactions for specific"
" genes/proteins from BioGRID, filtered for potential chemical relevance. "
"\\*\\*Important limitation\\*\\*: The BioGRID REST API does not support "
"chemical-only queries — you MUST provide gene\\_names. The chemicalList "
"parameter is unreliable. For drug-protein interaction queries, prefer "
"ChEMBL\\_search\\_mechanisms or DGIdb\\_search\\_interactions instead. "
"\\*\\*Prerequisites\\*\\*: Requires BIOGRID\\_API\\_KEY environment "
"variable (free academic API key at https://webservice.thebiogrid.org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:79
