#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:45 296c7e4897fb42b3940db76a99e05020
msgid ""
"``interaction_action`` (string) (optional) Filter by interaction action "
"type (e.g., 'inhibitor', 'activator', 'antagonist', 'agonist'). Leave "
"empty for all actions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:48 a8561fb9caa94c96af466400a3991bdd
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of chemical interactions to"
" return (default: 100, max: 10000)"
msgstr ""

