#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:69 d3d6cc4346c94e749b1444ed40ca5ed5
msgid ""
"Query experimentally validated protein and genetic interactions from "
"BioGRID (Biological General ..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst 6d4a7757d0e74686a1d7e32ad36c26a2
msgid "BioGRID_get_interactions tool specification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:75 1c2bd0adde4947ea922dd2b64f2bc41d
msgid "**Name**: ``BioGRID_get_interactions``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:77 57fe7512d4084e4ab4b33260728ed48e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Query experimentally validated protein and genetic "
"interactions from BioGRID (Biological General Repository for Interaction "
"Datasets). Returns curated interactions from published studies with "
"evidence methods, PubMed citations, and throughput information. "
"\\*\\*Prerequisites\\*\\*: Requires BIOGRID\\_API\\_KEY environment "
"variable (free academic API key at https://webservice.thebiogrid.org/). "
"BioGRID contains 2.3M+ interactions from 80+ organisms, all "
"experimentally validated (no predictions). Use for: finding "
"experimentally proven interactions, getting literature evidence for "
"interactions, validating predicted interactions, finding interaction "
"methods used, accessing high-confidence curated data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:81 c67283ec828d4d13a217aacde5532623
msgid ""
"``gene_names`` (array) (optional) List of gene names or protein "
"identifiers (e.g., ['TP53', 'BRCA1', 'MYC']). Accepts official gene "
"symbols."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:84 77828789af2048318135a93867938a11
msgid ""
"``gene_name`` (string) (optional) Alias for gene\\_names: single gene "
"symbol (e.g., 'TP53'). Converted to gene\\_names list automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:87 7b1994fae7d34451a02ec63274cec37d
msgid ""
"``organism`` (string) (optional) Organism name (e.g., 'Homo sapiens', "
"'Mus musculus') or NCBI taxonomy ID (e.g., '9606' for human, '10090' for "
"mouse). Default: 9606 (human)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:90 cfec2c2d19cc4f60be2d6a99f07ec54b
msgid ""
"``interaction_type`` (string) (optional) Type of interaction: 'physical' "
"(protein-protein), 'genetic' (epistasis, synthetic lethality), 'both' "
"(all interactions)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:93 57f1a1c4b425447eb26a50aaa010b91c
msgid ""
"``evidence_types`` (array) (optional) Filter by evidence types (e.g., "
"['Affinity Capture-MS', 'Two-hybrid'] for physical, ['Synthetic "
"Lethality', 'Dosage Rescue'] for genetic). Leave empty for all evidence "
"types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:96 9cefbab14cf64894902c93c05ad3c630
msgid ""
"``limit`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of interactions to return "
"(default: 100, max: 10000)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/biogrid_tools.rst:99 6c4533d8750b431c823bbe42ff143094
msgid ""
"``throughput`` (string) (optional) Filter by throughput: 'low' (low-"
"throughput studies), 'high' (high-throughput screens), or leave empty for"
" all"
msgstr ""

